# Book summaries and composition dates, curated from a conservative, Reformed evangelical position
# (R.C. Sproul / Ligonier Ministries, the Reformation Study Bible and standard conservative introductions).
# Positions taken: Mosaic authorship of the Pentateuch with the early (1446 BC) Exodus; one Isaiah; Daniel in the
# sixth century BC; traditional authorship wherever scripture or the early church supports it; the New Testament
# complete within the apostolic age. Where conservative scholars themselves differ (Joel, Obadiah, Galatians,
# Revelation), the range covers the conservative options and the label says so.
# Years: negative = BC. Loaded by gen_phase2_adjust.py into bible.book.

BASIS = 'Conservative Reformed evangelical (Ligonier; Reformation Study Bible)'

